      "content": "A Trade commit between browse pages expires the cursor, so reviews spanning more than 200 Open Trades can reject here instead of using the bounded assembly retries. `open()` only retries after a completed Ready pass and does not catch this exception. Treat cursor expiration as a retryable assembly change, restarting from the first page and returning ChangedDuringAssembly if all three attempts are exhausted. Add a test that commits a Trade change between pages.",
