      "path": "src/coordinators/daily-review/attention.ts",
      "content": "Compare Last Activity as instants rather than raw strings. Stored economic times are retained as supplied, so even valid UTC strings with different fractional precision sort incorrectly: `2026-10-12T15:00:00Z` sorts ahead of `2026-10-12T15:00:00.500Z`, although it is older. Equivalent instant spellings also bypass the Trade-ID tie-break. Use `Temporal.Instant.compare` (as Trade Record does) to preserve the required chronological ordering.",
